I continue my story.
I reached my new building.
I took my heavy suitcase and went to my door.
I was very tired.
Suddenly, a woman opened her door.
She looked at me and smiled.
She said, "Hello, I am Asha."
A small dog also came out.
Asha said, "This is Moti."
Moti came near my bag.
I petted him.
Asha asked, "Are you new here?"
I said, "Yes, I came from Mexico just today."
She asked, "Do you need water?"
She gave me a bottle of cold water.
I drank the water.
I felt very happy.
Asha was my first friend in Mumbai.
Amit, Neha, and Sanjay listen to my story.
Sanjay says, "Asha is a good neighbor."
